# MARKLAND_E2E_SECRET

The shared secret that gates `/api/test/mint-magic-link` on prod.

Used by: `.gauntlet/cards/magic-link-cross-site-click.md`

Copy this file to `e2e-mint-secret.md` (no `.example` suffix) and
replace `<paste-value-here>` with the value that was passed to
`flyctl secrets set MARKLAND_E2E_SECRET=...` when the secret was last
rotated. The card will `read` the resulting file at run time.

```
MARKLAND_E2E_SECRET=<paste-value-here>
```

Rotation: when this is rotated on Fly, update this file locally too.
The plaintext value is not recoverable from Fly — it must be
re-generated and re-set on both sides at the same time. Suggested
generator: `openssl rand -hex 32`.
